- pjit/noise.py: the H100 noise kernel, reformatted, reduced to what the node needs, with a NOISE wrapper added.
- pjit/upsampler.py: the prompt upsampler, with a local backend added at the end of the file.
- pjit/model.py, pjit/guidance.py: reimplemented on ComfyUI's ops after Linum's model.py and sampler.py, keeping their
  module names so the released weights load as they are.

The model weights are not part of this repository:

